  "notes": "Cash basis. beginning_cash/ending_cash are the governmental fund balances the statement rolls forward (1,030,233 -> 1,062,465); fund assets at year end 1,065,870 less taxes payable 3,406. Governmental statement lists spending by object only; functions taken from the dominant fund column. Interest income is shown under other financing sources below Total Receipts (outside_printed_total). Business-type (Water, Sewer, Solid Waste) rolls cash-basis net position (cash less sales tax collected). Balance sheet = government-wide cash-basis Statement of Net Position, Total column; Elwood Care Center component unit excluded throughout (budget schedule p9 Nursing Home lines skipped). Detail: General Fund from the departmental combining statement (p10); the p9 all-funds budget schedule contributes only the Street, CRA, Water, Sewer and Solid Waste spending lines (its revenue lines are not by fund). The report has many 1-dollar rounding differences (report_discrepancies). Read pages 1-10 of 10."
